### List all category groups
GET http://localhost:8088/api/v1/category-groups

### Create a category group
POST http://localhost:8088/api/v1/category-groups
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Spending" }

### Rename a category group (replace 1 with a real id)
PUT http://localhost:8088/api/v1/category-groups/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Expenses" }

### Delete a category group (its categories become Ungrouped)
DELETE http://localhost:8088/api/v1/category-groups/1
